{"product_id":"clinical-sports-nutrition-5th-edition","title":"Clinical Sports Nutrition 5th edition","description":"\u003cp\u003ePublisher's Note: Products purchased from Third Party sellers are not guaranteed by the publisher for quality, authenticity, or access to any online entitlements included with the product.Clinical Sports Nutrition 5th Edition is a cornerstone of the Sports Medicine series offered by McGraw-Hill. This complete practical and clinical reference provides the latest sports nutrition information, drawing on scientific research from around the globe. All chapters have been substantially revised and updated with contributions from leading academics, physicians and sports dietitians in Australia, Canada, the United States and the United Kingdom. In addition there are seven new commentaries:· A molecular view of exercise· Female athlete triad and energy availability· Measuring energy availability· Treating low energy availability· Vegetarian eating· Antioxidant supplementation and exercise· Fluid guidelinesThis respected reference work is an invaluable asset for students and instructors in the discipline of sports nutrition, and is also essential reading for elite athletes, sports professionals and trainers who need to keep their knowledge current.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 181 x 242\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Louise Burke\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781743073681\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 828\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45803714707609,"sku":"ACA-29781743073681","price":50.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68f3be4350158_614MyIApBLL._UF350_350_QL50.jpg?v=1760806306","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/clinical-sports-nutrition-5th-edition","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}